--- !u!114 &1866100358
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 1866100355}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: d74de834ec21f2a4ea49d5175949115a, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  texts:
  - Hi, welcome to the tutorial
  - This game was made for the Jame gam oct 2026, im just a little guy
  - Here you are a little 1x1 and you have to fix a painting
  - Try moving around with arrow keys/ WASD and jumping with space
  - And you see that little white square, that's your point!
  - Move the point around with your cursor (The black dot)
  - And try picking up those blue blocks, those are platform blocks, they dont count
    toward the total completion and can be used for moving
  - Placing platform blocks on the piece can help you get around
  - Now try going through that staircase on the left
  - See those blocks there?, those are the actual pieces you will use to restore
    the painting
  - Holding right mouse button will bring up the finished  image
  - While left mouse button will show you a hint for the pieces
  - Your goal is to put all the pieces in the correct place, then fit yourself into
    the last empty space after all the pieces have been used
  - Then press the submit button, and hopefully you have finished the puzzle
  - One last thing, you can control how far your point is by scrolling in and out
    and rotating blocks with q
  - Happy painting, even though you're just a little guy, I believe in you!
  number: 0
  stuffText: {fileID: 1818513340}
